Reading: loss_e = pure |.|-loss (cancellation inside the fluctuation that pointwise
partial summation cannot see). If reach_exact/const still hits ~4.4-4.6 at n0=2000-5000,
the a-priori collective chain closes mid-plunge with a few hundred resolved primes;
if reach dies at every cut, the charge loss beats self-averaging and mean-square
(large-sieve) pricing replaces pointwise partial summation as the named ingredient.
